tn 09 ab 1234        -> TN09AB1234 -> TN 09 AB 1234
KA-01-M-0007         -> KA01M0007  -> KA 01 M 0007
TN9AB1234            -> TN9AB1234  -> district must be two digits
TN 22 1234 AB        -> TN221234AB -> series must be one or two letters
mh 12 q 9876         -> MH12Q9876  -> MH 12 Q 9876
DL-05-ZZ-4321        -> DL05ZZ4321 -> DL 05 ZZ 4321
T1-09-AB-1234        -> T109AB1234 -> state must be two letters
TN-09-A1-1234        -> TN09A11234 -> series must be one or two letters
TN-09-AB-12X4        -> TN09AB12X4 -> final section must be four digits
text.upper() returns a new string: tn 09 ab 1234 => TN 09 AB 1234
For 10 chars: s[-4:] = 1234 ; s[4:-1] = AB123
For 6 chars: s[-4:] selects last four; s[4:-1] selects index 4 only.
Regex alternative: ^[A-Z]{2}[0-9]{2}[A-Z]{1,2}[0-9]{4}$; both scan O(n), O(n) temporary slicing bound.
